BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (BIC  Mock Trading Tournament Rules) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 56 687 Td (Babcock Investors Club · Tournament Handbook) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 56 649 Td (1. Format) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 626 Td (The tournament runs for a fixed window \(typically 48 weeks\). Each participant starts with a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 609 Td (virtual portfolio of ¦1,000,000 and trades in a simulated environment using real-world price) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 592 Td (data for NGX-listed equities and ETFs \(and, where enabled, forex and crypto pairs\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 56 563 Td (2. Trading rules) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 540 Td (Simulated transaction costs of 0.5% per trade apply  this discourages reckless day-trading) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 523 Td (and teaches fee awareness. No single stock may exceed 25% of portfolio value at purchase) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 506 Td (\(diversification cap\). Orders execute at the simulated price at the time of submission.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 489 Td (Leverage and derivatives are not permitted unless announced.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 56 460 Td (3. Scoring  risk-adjusted returns) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 437 Td (Ranking is NOT by raw return alone. Winners are judged by the Sharpe ratio: the portfolios) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 420 Td (excess return divided by its volatility. This rewards consistent, controlled returns over) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 403 Td (gambling on high-beta stocks. A portfolio that loses more than 30% of its starting value) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 386 Td (\(maximum drawdown\) is disqualified  risk management is part of the game.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 56 357 Td (4. Submitting your strategy) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 334 Td (Participants may earn bonus points for documenting a strategy  a trade journal and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 317 Td (investment thesis explaining each position. Judges award the bonus at the closing ceremony.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 56 288 Td (5. Prizes & recognition) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 265 Td (Top performers receive certificates and prizes, and results are celebrated on the clubs) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 248 Td (channels. Top ten finishers get fast-track entry into the clubs analyst development track.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 56 219 Td (6. Code of conduct) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 196 Td (No collusion, no multi-accounting, no manipulation of the simulator. Any violation leads to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 179 Td (disqualification. Play fair  the point is to learn how real markets reward discipline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 148 Td (Rules may be updated per edition. The current editions rules override this handbook.) Tj ET
